  {
    "key": "trade_balance_desc",
    "type": 0,
    "en": "If the balance is in your settlement's favour (right), then you are asking for more than you are offering. If the balance is in the merchant's favour (left), then you are giving more than you are asking for. Only transactions under the Bargain Threshold are possible. The Bargain Threshold is influenced by the bartering settler's Speechcraft skill.",
